{
  "about": "Helix -> Agent One Finance rename, as data. Read by apps/backend/scripts/aof_convert.py. Rules run in this order: moves, file names, literal text, then patterns. 'skip' paths are never touched; 'skip_text' files may be renamed but their contents are left alone. FOBO keeps its own names. A line containing 'aof-convert: keep' is left as it is.",
