    ]
  },
  "outside_the_code": [
    "Entitlement roles HELIX_*_OWNER and HELIX_PLATFORM_ADMIN become AOF_*_OWNER and AOF_PLATFORM_ADMIN; the entitlement lookup becomes ?app=aof.",
    "Proxies, bots and webhooks send X-AOF-User, X-AOF-Event-Secret, X-AOF-Proxy-Secret and X-AOF-Webhook-Secret.",
    "Database: alembic upgrade head runs e7f9a1b3c5d7, which renames helix_* tables to aof_* and re-keys workflow checkpoints helix:<case> to aof:<case>.",
    "Phoenix dashboards and alerts filtering on helix.* span attributes now filter on aof.*.",
    "Browser storage keys helix.user and helix.theme become aof.user and aof.theme: people choose their user and theme once more."
  ],
  "skip_text": [
    "(^|/)package-lock\\.json$",
    "\\.(png|jpe?g|gif|ico|pdf|xlsx|docx|pptx|woff2?|ttf|mp4|webm|zip|gz|pyc)$"
  ]
}
